  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.upgrade_multiplier": "最大升级倍率",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.upgrade_multiplier.tooltip": "强化速度/能量升级的基础倍率：强化线插满时得到这个倍率。\n默认值：20\n「最大升级数」高于 16 时该倍率稀释为 倍率^(16/最大升级数)；原版那条线本身仍按 10^(最大升级数/8) 增长，上限调高一样会更快、储能更大。",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.upgrade_max": "最大升级数",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.upgrade_max.tooltip": "机器可安装的速度/能量升级最大数量（8-32）。\n默认值：16\n原版速度/能量升级插满后，才会启用对应的强化升级。",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.empowered_upgrade_max": "最大强化升级数",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.empowered_upgrade_max.tooltip": "机器可安装的强化速度/能量升级最大数量（1-32）。\n默认值：16\n只决定强化层的总加成被拆成几级；插满时的总加成由「最大升级倍率」决定。",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.enchantable_meka_gear": "Meka 装备可附魔",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.enchantable_meka_gear.tooltip": "允许 Meka 装甲/工具被附魔。你需要自行将物品加入可附魔标签。",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.vanilla_energy_offset_rate": "原版能量升级抵消率",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.vanilla_energy_offset_rate.tooltip": "原版能量升级能抵掉多少比例的“提速额外耗能”（0.0-1.0）。\n默认值：1.0\n1.0 即原版行为：能量与速度升级数量相同时，每操作耗电回到基础值。调低即整条线更费电。",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.empowered_energy_offset_rate": "强化能量升级抵消率",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.empowered_energy_offset_rate.tooltip": "强化能量升级能抵掉多少比例的“强化提速额外耗能”（0.0-1.0）。\n默认值：0.5\n默认只抵掉一半，插满强化线后每操作耗电高于原版；填 1.0 完全抵消。",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.max_operations_per_tick": "每 tick 最大操作次数",
  "configuration.mekanism_empowered_unleashed.general.misc.max_operations_per_tick.tooltip": "电动泵、数字矿机、流体装填器、公式装配器每 tick 的补次上限（1-10000）。\n默认值：128\n速度升级超过这个值后，对这四台机器不再有可见效果；调得过高会拖慢服务器。",
